# This repo: `wwn-toolchain` (L0)

Substrate only (cairo, pango, pixman, fontconfig, libwayland, epoll-shim, …).

## You own

- Toolchain recipes, shims, baseRegistry keys for **non-graphics** substrate.

## You do NOT own (never add here)

- Desktop / LockScreen, Swinging Bridge, VMs, containers, Wasm Runtime / `wpm`
- ANGLE / MoltenVK / iland / weston / kmscube flake inputs or registry keys

See always-applied `wawona-product-map` and `Wawona/docs/wwn-repo-dag.md`.
If a change needs product Mode A/B policy, document it in Wawona — do not invent
toolchain Mode B paths.
